From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SeanChuang2 <Sean.Chuang@advantech.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 13:37:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] [AOM-5521] Rework M7 resource ownership

Adjust the M7 logical machine resource assignments in the EVK
config to match the Advantech AOM-5521 board:

- Move CAN_FD1 from M7 to the A55 (AP)
- Move pins GPIO_IO14/IO15 from M7 to the AP
- Drop LPUART3 from M7 ownership

On this board GPIO_IO14/IO15 carry DEBUG_UART_SEL and LCD0_VDD_EN
(module schematic A201-2, sheet 16 and 18), which the AP drives as
plain GPIOs. LPUART3 itself is therefore left unowned rather than
handed to the AP: nothing on AOM-5521 muxes those pads to the
peripheral, and SM resource ownership decides who may change its
clock and power state.

That last point is the whole reason AOM-2521 keeps a separate copy
of this patch instead of sharing this one. There GPIO_IO14/IO15 are
the UART_C TXD/RXD pair, so its copy moves LPUART3 to the AP as
well. A change made for one board must not reach the other by way
of a shared file.

Squashed from the Advantech fork branch
lf-6.12.20-2.0.0-imx95-aom5521a2, commits d5e5b7a and 4696030, and
rebased onto the SRCREV meta-imx pins.

configs/mx95evk/config_{scmi,trdc,bctrl,test}.h are not carried
here: the recipe's do_configure runs "make cfg", which regenerates
that whole directory from mx95evk.cfg with configtool.pl and
overwrites whatever is in the tree.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [configuration]

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Tom Hsieh <Tom.Hsieh@advantech.com>
---
diff --git a/configs/mx95evk.cfg b/configs/mx95evk.cfg
index 8ac5392..4f85ec8 100755
--- a/configs/mx95evk.cfg
+++ b/configs/mx95evk.cfg
@@ -397,14 +397,12 @@ SYS                       ALL
 # Resources
 
 M7P                 OWNER  # CPUs must be first
-CAN_FD1             OWNER
 FSB                 READONLY
 IRQSTEER_M7         OWNER
 LPIT1               OWNER
 LPTMR1              OWNER
 LPTMR2              OWNER
 LPTPM1              OWNER
-LPUART3             OWNER, test
 MSGINTR1            OWNER
 MSGINTR2            OWNER
 MU5_A               OWNER
@@ -419,9 +417,6 @@ WDOG5               OWNER
 
 # Pins
 
-PIN_GPIO_IO14       OWNER
-PIN_GPIO_IO15       OWNER
-
 # Memory
 
 M7MIX               DATA, begin=0x020380000, end=0x02047FFFF
@@ -618,6 +613,7 @@ CAMERA5             OWNER
 CAMERA6             OWNER
 CAMERA7             OWNER
 CAMERA8             OWNER
+CAN_FD1             OWNER
 CAN_FD2             OWNER
 CAN_FD3             OWNER
 CAN_FD4             OWNER
@@ -945,6 +941,8 @@ PIN_GPIO_IO10        OWNER
 PIN_GPIO_IO11        OWNER
 PIN_GPIO_IO12        OWNER
 PIN_GPIO_IO13        OWNER
+PIN_GPIO_IO14        OWNER
+PIN_GPIO_IO15        OWNER
 PIN_GPIO_IO16        OWNER
 PIN_GPIO_IO17        OWNER
 PIN_GPIO_IO18        OWNER
